  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2023-25 Bolivia: Journalism and freedom of expression</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">2023-25 Bolivia: Journalistik och yttrandefrihet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By the end of the intervention, it is expected that the at least 80 journalists who
will be benefiting from the planned activities under this contribution will  i) better
know their rights and obligations within the framework of the legislation that
protects freedom of expression, and ii) acquire skills to help them improve their
physical, legal, digital, and psychoemotional security. In the end, the final goal is
to achieve better and safer practices of journalism in Bolivia.

Other objectives by the end of the initiative are to have at least ten publications
on topics such as: freedom of expression, human rights and the work of
journalism in democracy and at least eight bulletins with information related to
the present initiative are disseminated.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningarna f&#xf6;r journalister att ut&#xf6;va djupg&#xe5;ende journalistik fri fr&#xe5;n hot och censur</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve conditions for journalists to practice in-depth journalism free from threats and censorships</narrative>
  </description>
